{"id":271,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","X","LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It lives at the water’s edge where it is sunny. It sleeps on a bed of water grass by day and becomes active at night."},{"games":["Sword","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It is nocturnal and becomes active at nightfall. It feeds on aquatic mosses that grow in the riverbed."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Lombre’s entire body is covered by a slippery, slimy film. It feels horribly unpleasant to be touched by this Pokémon’s hands. Lombre is often mistaken for a human child."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Lombre is nocturnal—it will get active after dusk. It is also a mischief maker. When this Pokémon spots anglers, it tugs on their fishing lines from beneath the surface and enjoys their consternation."},{"games":["Y","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It has a mischievous spirit. If it spots an angler, it will tug on the fishing line to interfere."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"In the evening, it takes great delight in popping out of rivers and startling people. It feeds on aquatic moss that grows on rocks in the riverbed."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Swift Swim","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in rain."},{"name":"Rain Dish","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon gradually regains HP in rain."},{"name":"Own Tempo","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon sticks to its own tempo, preventing it from becoming confused or being affected by Intimidate."}],"eggGroups":["Water 1","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":15,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium slow","habitat":"water's edge","color":"Green","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":270,"name":"Lotad","condition":null,"children":[{"id":271,"name":"Lombre","condition":"Lv. 14","children":[{"id":272,"name":"Ludicolo","condition":"Use Water Stone","children":[]}]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,45],[1,55],[1,71],[1,175],[1,252],[1,28